Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: verified defects #1,2,3,4,5 + Finding A skill-name
 collapse + the 5 skill renames

Handoff doc: 2026-08-07 / 2026-08-08 UTP dev-review.

Verified-current defects:
- #1 light-mode status colors (WCAG AA fail): wire RUN_STATUS_COLORS /
  MODULE_STATUS_COLORS / CALL_SESSION_STATUS_COLORS to the existing
  --error/--success/--text-secondary tokens instead of flat rose-400/
  amber-400/gold classes. Also fixes a regression this introduced in
  global-search.tsx, which was string-sniffing the old class names --
  replaced with a proper runStatusDotColor() export.
- #2 UTC-hardcoded crons: nightly-briefs, credential-health,
  lost-deal-sweep, and weekly-metrics crons now poll hourly and gate on
  each engagement's own stack.timezone (defaults to UTC, same pattern
  leak-map-schedule-cron already used). No behavior change until an
  engagement sets a non-UTC timezone.
- #3 branded 404: added root not-found.tsx.
- #4 hardcoded hex bypassing tokens: consolidated the real duplicates
  (bg-[#3f3f42] x12, bg-[#7fe3d4] x5, bg-[#82e6d4]/[#05221d] x5 files,
  bg-[#f15153]/[#e0484a], the 7x-duplicated dashboard dot-grid
  background, and the duplicated OAuth-redirect HTML). Left the
  genuinely enumerated palettes (tag-color picker, skill badge colors)
  and buyer-facing template HTML alone -- not duplication, by design.
- #5 --gold stale naming: renamed --gold/--gold-hover/--gold-foreground
  to --ink/--ink-hover/--ink-foreground across all consumers, value
  unchanged.
- #6 (landing vs dashboard aesthetic) intentionally NOT touched -- the
  doc leaves this as an open design decision, not a locked spec.

Finding A + the 5 skill renames:
- skill-manifest.ts is now the single source for skill display names.
  copy.ts's SKILL_INFO derives name from it (keeps its own description --
  different audience, not part of the drift).
  queue-panel.tsx's hardcoded label record now derives from copy.ts.
- Swept for additional drift beyond the doc's original 3 sources; found
  and fixed 3 more independently-hardcoded copies in
  master-roster-calendar.tsx, inbox/page.tsx, and
  win-back-revenue-section.tsx.
- Renames: Pin Down/Pin-Down -> Show Rate Setup, Pile On/Pile-On ->
  Pre-Call Sequence, Pre-Call Read -> Call Brief, Win-Back -> Booking
  Recovery, Leak Map/Leak-Map -> Funnel Audit. Display layer only --
  internal SkillId/SKILL_IDS, DB skillRuns.skillName values, route
  segments, Inngest event names, and schema JSON keys untouched, per
  the doc's explicit boundary. The 7 LLM system prompts and
  export-to-skill-pack.ts also untouched, per the doc.

Verified: tsc --noEmit clean against baseline (13 pre-existing errors,
all in unrelated test files, zero new). vitest run matches the
pre-existing 7-failed/13-passed baseline on unmodified main (sandbox DB
mock limitation, not a regression). Full old-name-literal grep across
src/ returns zero remaining hits.
